        "description": "**Height:** 175 cm (5'9)\n\nHe works as an exercise instructor (or gymnastics teacher) for the educational TV program \"Together with Mama\". The characters of his name implies that he is two-faced.\n\nHe was among one of the elites in Nippon Sport Science University, which is known for its many famous athletes.\n\nWhen he has some free time after work, he enjoys taking some time to relax his muscles because it makes him forget about his problems, otherwise he \"drops dead\".",
