        },
        "description": "**Height:** 184 cm (6\")\n**Smoker:** His body can't handle it\n**Alcohol:** Incredibly weak\n\nOne of the song instructors along with Tadano Utano. His name is a pun meaning \"But I'm handsome\".\nFormer musical actor with a beautiful voice and a face that girls can't resist.\nHe loves low level puns, he can't read between the lines or take a hint. He can't even read a clock.\nHe has an obsession over food, making him think about food constantly.",
