        "description": "**Height**: 162 cm (5'3\")\n\nOne of the song instructors along with Daga Iketeru. Her name is a pun meaning \"Just a singer\".\n\nFormer washed up pop idol, then cover singer, then Jazz singer at a nightclub. She graduated from an elite music school, but because of bad luck or poor timing, her career got unstable.\n\nShe's been living together with her comedian boyfriend for 6 years and constantly talks about marriage.",
